<title>SWEDEN: Astra says Oxis Turbuhaler approved in.</title>
<headline>Astra says Oxis Turbuhaler approved in.</headline>
<dateline>STOCKHOLM 1997-03-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Swedish pharmaceutical comany Astra AB said on Friday it won European approval for its asthma treatment Oxis Turbuhaler and planned to launch it in Europe at the beginning of the next quarter.</p>
</text>
